  "releaseNotes": "v9.0.7: Cleaner void-like handlers! IRequestHandler<TRequest> and IPvNugsMediatorRequestHandler<TRequest> now return Task instead of Task<Unit> - no need to return Unit.Value anymore! Single-parameter interfaces no longer inherit from two-parameter versions, providing cleaner API. Fully backward compatible - existing handlers continue to work. Previous: v9.0.6 simplified PvNugs handler interfaces.",
